Blue Pine Mail
==============

Blue Pine Mail is a modified, downstream version of Mailflare.

Upstream project
----------------
Mailflare - Email for professionals and teams
https://github.com/hieunc229/mailflare
Copyright (C) 2026 Hieu Nguyen

The upstream copyright and license notices are preserved. Contributions by
other upstream contributors are recorded in the git history.

Modifications
-------------
Modifications by Blue Pine Solutions, 2026-09-28.

Downstream changes in this repository to date:

- Manual (self-hosted) domain setup works without Cloudflare credentials.
- MX setup for manually managed domains no longer attempts a Cloudflare
  lookup.
- The inbound SMTP listener rejects recipients that do not exist on this
  installation instead of accepting them.

The git history of https://github.com/bofa-ds/mailflare identifies each
change individually.

